flowchart TD
  %% Handoff Hierarchical ESG Flow (conceptual)
  Start([Start]) --> LoadData["Load preprocessed report/dataset"]
  LoadData --> Segment["Segment report into content chunks for retrieval"]
  Segment --> Store["Store chunks in retrieval/index store (ChunkStore)"]
  Store --> Prepare["Log/Timer: parse timing recorded"]

  subgraph DomainLoop [Process each ESG domain sequentially]
    direction TB
    DomainStart["Select next domain to evaluate (environmental/social/governance)"] --> Retrieve["Retrieve a broader set of relevant chunks for that domain"]
    Retrieve --> Partition["Partition retrieved chunks across hierarchical worker groups (split work among specialists)"]
    Partition --> ParallelWorkers["Each worker group analyzes its subset in parallel and returns a partial judgment"]
    ParallelWorkers --> MergeDecision["Are multiple worker outputs available?"]
    MergeDecision -- Yes --> Merge["Merge worker judgments into a single domain score (e.g. average score, combined rationale)"]
    MergeDecision -- No --> SingleAnalyst["Fallback: single analyst forms the domain judgment"]
    Merge --> FinalizeDomain["Finalize DomainScore with merged score, confidence, rationale, and used chunks"]
    SingleAnalyst --> FinalizeDomain
    FinalizeDomain --> RecordTrace["Record retrieval & worker trace (who used which chunks)"]
    RecordTrace --> NextDomain["Store domain score & proceed to next domain"]
  end

  DomainLoop --> Aggregate["Aggregate domain scores into total score & overall confidence"]
  Aggregate --> Evaluate["Compute metrics: coverage, hallucination, agreement, latency, MAE/accuracy, deliberation"]
  Evaluate --> Compare["Compare predicted total to ground truth"]
  Compare --> Result["Produce final run result (pattern=handoff_hierarchical) with domain scores, traces, metrics"]
  Result --> End([End])

  %% Key differences: hierarchical handoff divides work across worker groups, then aggregates — more agent calls, increased deliberation and potential for richer rationales
  classDef note fill:#fffae6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
  Note["Key: hierarchical handoff → parallel sub-workers per domain; outputs merged into final domain judgment; higher compute & deliberation"]:::note
  DomainLoop --> Note


